# 独立市场 Pages 构建配置示例，不是主站 .env；构建入口不会自动加载此文件。
# Dedicated catalog Pages build example, not the main-site .env; the build does not load this file.
# 在市场 Pages 控制台设置以下环境变量；不得填入主站或预览部署地址。
# Set these variables in the catalog Pages dashboard; do not use the main site or a preview URL.
CATALOG_PUBLIC_URL=https://your-catalog.pages.dev

# 只读 GitHub Token，仅用于公开仓库的 GitHub API；不授予仓库写入权限。
# Read-only GitHub token for public-repository API access; do not grant repository write permissions.
# 必须配置为构建 Secret，禁止加 VITE_ 前缀、提交到 Git 或放入静态产物。
# Store as a build secret; never use a VITE_ prefix, commit it, or include it in static output.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# 关闭平台自动安装，只安装此子项目锁定的依赖，避免安装整个主站。
# Skip automatic installation; install only this subproject's locked dependencies.
SKIP_DEPENDENCY_INSTALL=1

# 同日已发布且协议兼容时跳过采集；true 仅供用户明确要求的单次强制构建。
# Reuse a compatible published batch from the same day; true is for a deliberate one-off rebuild.
CATALOG_FORCE=false

# Pages 项目必须独立连接 Git，且名称与本目录 wrangler.jsonc 的 name 一致。
# Connect a dedicated Pages project to Git and match the name in this directory's wrangler.jsonc.
# 项目根目录 / Root directory: marketplace-catalog
# 构建命令 / Build command: npm ci --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund && npm run build
# 输出目录 / Build output directory: dist
# Node 版本由 .node-version 固定；禁止设置 CATALOG_OUTPUT 改写工作目录。
# Node is pinned in .node-version; do not set CATALOG_OUTPUT to override the workspace.
# 禁止上传 output、源码、Functions 或主站构建；仅发布已校验的 dist。
# Publish only validated dist, never output, sources, Functions, or the main-site build.
#
# 采集、恢复、验证共用 15 分钟预算；安装与平台发布需计入完整的 20 分钟验收。
# Collection, restore, and validation share 15 minutes; include install and deployment in the 20-minute acceptance check.
# 全批最多 6000 请求、256 MiB 网络数据；公开产物最多 15000 文件、256 MiB。
# Per run: at most 6000 requests and 256 MiB transferred; output: at most 15000 files and 256 MiB.
# 生产版本与最多七个历史版本先去重预估再恢复；超预算失败，不自动删减来源或历史。
# Deduplicate and preflight production plus up to seven historical versions; fail over budget without silently dropping sources or history.
# 未发布检查点不保证跨失败构建保留；并发 Hook 不保证严格只执行一次。
# Unpublished checkpoints are not durable across failed builds; concurrent hooks are not exactly-once.
#
# build 成功仅表示产物准备完成；实际发布成功必须核对 Pages 部署记录及正式索引。
# A successful build only prepares artifacts; confirm deployment in Pages and the production index.
# 主站验收后设置 VITE_PUBLIC_CATALOG_* 并构建一次；之后日更不需要主站重新构建。
# After acceptance, set the main site's VITE_PUBLIC_CATALOG_* and rebuild it once; daily updates need no main-site rebuild.
# 调度器单独部署，Secret 与 Cron 说明见 scheduler/.dev.vars.example。
# Deploy the scheduler separately; see scheduler/.dev.vars.example for its secret and Cron setup.
# 旧 Actions 与 publish.ts 保留至新链路上线验收，不要提前删除。
# Keep the old Actions workflow and publish.ts until the new delivery path passes acceptance.
